# Install file: dependencies (client-core) as COPIES, not symlinks.
# A symlinked package's real path sits OUTSIDE this app, which forced
# `turbopack.root` up to the monorepo — putting wiki/.venv, server/, .git and
# every node_modules into the dev watcher + persistent-cache task graph
# (next-server leaked to ~60 GB; five OOMs on 2026-06-11). A copy keeps the
# package inside this app's tree: default Turbopack root, no second
# node_modules shadowing react/react-query during SSR.
# Consequence: after editing client-core/, re-run `npm install` here.
install-links=true
